{
  "name": "CC to CC with a range",
  "about": "CC 1 becomes CC 74 and its value is scaled from 20..100 onto 0..127, clamped at both ends.",
  "notes": [
    "scale: out = lo2 + round((clamp(v, lo, hi) - lo) * (hi2 - lo2) / (hi - lo)), and round is to nearest with ties AWAY FROM ZERO.",
    "Here lo 20, hi 100, lo2 0, hi2 127, so out = round((v - 20) * 127 / 80).",
    "v 10 clamps to 20, out 0 = 00.",
    "v 20 (0x14), out 0 = 00.",
    "v 40 (0x28): 20 * 127 / 80 = 31.75, out 32 = 20.",
    "v 60 (0x3C): 40 * 127 / 80 = 63.5, a TIE, away from zero, out 64 = 40.",
    "v 100 (0x64): 80 * 127 / 80 = 127 = 7F.",
    "v 120 (0x78) clamps to 100, out 7F.",
    "NEGATIVE CONTROL: CC 7 is not CC 1, and scale names cc 74, so B0 07 64 passes unchanged.",
    "NEGATIVE CONTROL: a note is not a CC and passes unchanged, velocity included."
  ],
